  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon sesame oil",
    "12 ounce ground pork",
    "3 tablespoon fresh ginger (grated)",
    "3 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1 1/2 cup green cabbage (shredded)",
    "1/4 cup carrot (shredded)",
    "1/4 cup gluten free soy sauce",
    "8 large egg",
    "1/2 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon avocado oil"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add the sesame oil along with the ground pork, grated ginger, and minced garlic.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together and break up the meat until the pork starts to brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the shredded cabbage, shredded carrots, and gluten free soy sauce. Stir together and let cook for 3-5 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, crack the eggs. Season with salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk them together until they are combined well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add the avocado oil. Pour the egg mixture in until it fills up the pan. Let this sit and cook for about 1-2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully flip over the egg wrap and let this side cook for 1-2 minutes. Move to a plate.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon the pork and vegetable mixture onto the egg wrap.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully roll the egg wrap like a burrito. Roll it over the pork then tuck both of the sides in and continue to roll.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Keto-Egg-Roll-Wrap-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-egg-roll-wrap/#wprm-recipe-54455-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
